      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1 · CALENDLY CONNECTS HERE\n\n**Needs:** a paid Calendly plan (Standard / Professional or higher). Webhooks do not exist on the Free plan.\n\n**Credential:** Calendly → Integrations → *API & Webhooks* → generate a **Personal Access Token** → paste it into a new *Calendly API* credential in n8n.\n\n**No URL to copy.** When you **activate** this workflow, n8n registers the webhook in Calendly for you. Your n8n must be on **https://**.",
        "height": 316,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 4
      },
      "name": "Sticky · Calendly Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
