    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2 · ⚙️ EDIT THIS ONE NODE\n\nEvery value a client changes lives in **⚙️ SETTINGS**: Slack channel, sender name, timezone, booking link, sheet ID, prep checklist.\n\n`cfg_calendly_event_filter` — leave empty to process every Calendly booking, or type part of the event name (e.g. `Discovery`) to ignore personal / internal event types.",
        "height": 268,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 3
